\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {18}{\ignorespaces Per-tenant agent profiles. Each subplot shows the three agents on a shared radar for one tenant. On Bertrand (dense, small) all agents overlap; on Cambford (temporal multi-hop) \textsc  {Researcher}'s citation and pass-rate advantage widens; on ZAI (large, bursty) \textsc  {ReAct-v1} matches or exceeds the planner on assertion accuracy.}}{31}{figure.caption.44}\protected@file@percent }
