\newlabel{fig:latency_vs_pass}{{22}{33}{Latency--quality trade-off: mean wall-clock time vs.\ pass rate. \textsc {Researcher} occupies the high-latency/high-quality quadrant while the two reactive agents cluster at low latency; \textsc {ReAct-v1} achieves $3.7\times $ lower latency than \textsc {Researcher} with only a modest pass-rate gap}{figure.caption.48}{}}
